# For Claude Code only

## Worktrees

Real worktrees are what `git worktree add` creates. A directory under
`.claude/worktrees/` is not necessarily a git worktree. Always check
`git worktree list` or `git rev-parse --show-toplevel`.

## Before every commit

Read `git diff --cached --stat` and inspect staged files. Ensure only your
intended changes are included.

## Subagents

No subagent pushes. A subagent may commit, but whether commits reach a remote is
always a human decision.
